{
  "id": "recover_a_planetkiller",
  "gameId": [
    "pk"
  ],
  "factionId": null,
  "icon": "graphics/icons/missions/planetkiller.png",
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "PK_NEXUS_KEY",
      "flag": "$pk_PK_NEXUS_KEY",
      "briefing": {
        "en": "Recover information about a Hegemony fleet last seen in a Tri-Tachyon held system during the first AI War, more than a hundred cycles ago. The fleet is rumored to have been carrying a planetkiller weapon.",
        "zh": "收集关于 一百多星历年前，在 第一次 AI 战争中 消失在 速子科技 控制区域的 霸主 舰队的信息。传言该舰队携带着一枚 行星杀手。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "PK_PLANET_KEY",
      "flag": "$pk_PK_PLANET_KEY",
      "briefing": {
        "en": "You've destroyed a remnant Nexus and recovered information about a Hegemony fleet estimated to be carrying a planetkiller weapon.",
        "zh": "此信息应该被存在一个 余辉中枢 的数据库中，该中枢位于 "
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "PK_SYSTEM_KEY",
      "flag": "$pk_PK_SYSTEM_KEY",
      "briefing": {
        "en": ", and implied that the planetkiller weapon could be found there.",
        "zh": "你已经摧毁了一个余辉中枢，且恢复了某支霸主舰队可能携带着一个行星杀手的数据。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "GO_TO_NEXUS",
      "flag": "$pk_GO_TO_NEXUS",
      "briefing": {
        "en": "Perhaps it brings 'much amusement' to this AI to not provide more detailed instructions.",
        "zh": "一段日志记录写道一支强大的 余辉秩序 被派出进行追击；最后的超波记录显示其位于 "
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "RECOVER_PK",
      "flag": "$pk_RECOVER_PK",
      "briefing": {
        "en": "The data banks of the remnant Nexus contained information about the Hegemony fleet rumored to be carrying a planetkiller weapon. ",
        "zh": "。此日志记录来自一百多星历年前的 第一次 AI 战争 中。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "COMPLETED",
      "flag": "$pk_COMPLETED",
      "briefing": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "一个神秘的声音，或许是某种 AI，告知了你 "
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "FAILED",
      "flag": "$pk_FAILED",
      "briefing": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "的地点，并暗示 行星杀手 也可在该处找到。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "Z",
      "flag": "$pk_Z",
      "briefing": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "或许这 AI 也是为了 '更加愉悦！' 而没有提供更多具体细节。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "F",
      "flag": "$pk_F",
      "briefing": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "余辉中枢的数据库存储了据传携带着行星杀手的 霸主 舰队的相关信息。 "
      }
    }
  ],
